<title>USA: Johnson &amp; Johnson deal includes options.</title>
<headline>Johnson &amp; Johnson deal includes options.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Johnson &amp; Johnson said its planned stock acquisition of Biopsys Medical Inc includes an unspecified amount of stock options and cash.</p>
<p>Based on the company's estimate of a $27.55 price for each share of Biopsys, the deal is valued at $270 million, excluding the cash and options.</p>
<p>Shares of Biopsys gained 1 to 26-3/4 in early trade. Johnson &amp; Johnson stock rose 3/8 to 59-3/4.</p>
</text>
